pipe_send | worker | actions message|operate | write=true stream=false | args PipeSendArgs | result WriteResult | guards target_recheck:KEEP(pane.identity),writer_lock:KEEP(pane.lock),pipe_limits:KEEP(pipe.budget),pane_busy:FORCE(pane.state),pane_dialog:FORCE(pane.state),pane_shell:FORCE(pane.kind),readiness_unknown:WARN(pane.state)
pipe_wait | worker | actions read | write=false stream=true | args PipeWaitArgs | result PipeTurn | guards -
