send_text | worker | actions operate | write=true stream=false | args SendTextArgs | result WriteResult | guards target_recheck:KEEP(pane.identity),writer_lock:KEEP(pane.lock),pane_busy:FORCE(pane.state),pane_dialog:FORCE(pane.state),pane_shell:FORCE(pane.kind),readiness_unknown:WARN(pane.state)
session_capture | worker | actions read | write=false stream=false | args SessionCaptureArgs | result SessionCaptureResult | guards -
